   "x": 697,
   "y": 396,
   "w": 300,
   "h": 96,
   "kind": "cts_t",
   "title": "Thumb, index, middle + ½ ring finger",
   "lines": [
    "• numbness and tingling, often AT NIGHT",
    "• worse with the wrist flexed or extended",
    "• ± thumb weakness (abductor pollicis brevis)"
   ]
  },
  {
